          <unicode>ᠳᠣᠲᠣᠷᠲᠠᠢ ᠳᠡᠪᠡᠯ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- debel</transcript>
          <definition> Lined clothes</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠮᠠᠭᠤ ᠳᠣᠲᠣᠷᠲᠠᠢ ᠺᠦᠮᠦᠨ</unicode>
          <transcript>maγu -- kymyn</transcript>
          <definition> Evil or malevolent person.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠰᠠᠶᠢᠬᠠᠨ ᠳᠣᠲᠣᠷᠲᠠᠢ ᠺᠦᠮᠦᠨ</unicode>
