        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠷ᠎ᠠ ᠳᠣᠲᠣᠷᠲᠠᠢ ᠳᠠᠶᠢᠰᠤᠨ</unicode>
          <transcript>xar-a -- daisun</transcript>
          <definition> Evil-hearted enemy.</definition>
